<title>EGYPT: Arafat in Cairo, seeing Mubarak.</title>
<headline>Arafat in Cairo, seeing Mubarak.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Cairo on Saturday and went straight into talks with Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak.</p>
<p>Arafat will brief Mubarak on his meeting this week with Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu, their first since Netanyahu took office in June.</p>
